PlayWright
----------------------
1. Playwright is functional automation tool, like selenium webdriver, cypress, etc.
2. PLaywright supports -> webbased application, Mobile web apps, API
3. Langugage Supported -> .net(C#), Javascripts, TypeScripts, Java, Python
4. Browser supports -> Chromium, WebKit(Safari) and Firefox (headless/headed).
5. OS Supported --> Windows, MacOs, Linux and Support CLI Runs


Features of Playwright
1. free and Open Source 
2. Multibrowser and multiple platform (OS & Langugage binding)
3. Easy setup and configuration.
4. Functional , APi, and accessibility testing.
5. CI, CD, Docker
6. Parallel testing.
7. Auto  wait mechanism - waits
8. Build in Assertions.
9. Multi tab and Multi window feature is available in playwright
10. Frames and shadow dom.
11. test parameter - parameterization 
12. Emulate the mobile devices
13. Fast


PlayWright Installations
------------------------------
1. Node.js 
2. VS Code
3. Create project folder -->  open in VSCode.
4. install playwright using terminal
			npm init playwright@latest

5. Install playwright using vs code extension.			























